{"sourceUrl":"https://mp.weixin.qq.com/s/rz5R1_y_u3-UsFl_aQTKAA","status":"full","attemptedAt":"2026-11-15T16:58:26.566076+00:00","httpStatus":200,"fetchedUrl":"https://mp.weixin.qq.com/s/rz5R1_y_u3-UsFl_aQTKAA","html":"<div><section><img loading=\"lazy\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" src=\"https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/mmbiz_gif/DC1I4Wibt8WP22DQhn92GKEl8ysFaCPwlNXDwuaibULia3tgvmhkwrQhcVGibPqpCvjia4CicEgoXmeogF3Ug30GqBzQ/640?wx_fmt=gif\"/></section><section><section><section><section><section><p><span><br/></span></p></section><section><section><section><p><span>在这个充满竞争的升学赛道上，我们都在努力寻找那条最适合自己的道路。暑期夏令营就像是一把神奇的钥匙，悄悄地为我们打开了通往更高学术殿堂的大门。它不是那种高不可攀的机会，而是真正为优秀学子量身定制的“成长加速器”。</span></p></section><section><section><p><span>建筑设备科学与工程学院(</span><span><span>https://bsse.xauat.edu.cn/)</span></span><span><span>现设有“供热、供燃气、通风及空调工程”“智能建筑”“人工环境工程（含供热、通风及空调等）”三个硕士研究生专业。</span></span></p></section></section><section><p><span>其中“供热、供燃气、通风及空调工程”专业办学历史悠久，学科专业基础深厚，最早可追溯至1952年东北工学院建筑系成立的“建筑设备”教研室，1959年毕业了全国首届供热通风专业研究生（指导老师为苏联专家“格·阿·马克西莫夫”教授），1979年招收首批“供热通风工程”硕士生，并于1984年、1998年先后获准“供热、供燃气、通风及空调工程”硕士和博士学位授予权，是国内当时本学科领域拥有博士点的四所高校之一；“智能建筑”专业办学可追溯至1998年，基于土木建筑、信息等交叉学科基础，于国内最早一批开展智能建筑方向研究生培养工作，2005年获批国内第一个“智能建筑环境技术”二级学科博士点，2017年遴选为安德学院国际化中外合作办学专业。</span></p></section><section><section><p><span>充分发挥专业优势，积极探索“建筑环境”“建筑智能化”等学科间的交叉</span><span>融合创新，现拥有1个国家重点培育学科（“暖通”学科）、1个省级重点学科、1个二级学科博士点、1个工程博士点、1个二级交叉学科博士点以及2个二级学术学位硕士点和1个专业学位硕士点。</span></p></section></section><section><p><span>西安建筑科技大学建筑设备科学与工程学院拟于8月中旬开展2026年优秀研究生生源选拔暑期夏令营活动，欢迎全国各地优秀学子前来报名！</span></p></section></section></section><section><p><span><br/></span></p></section><section><section><section><section><section><section><section><section><span><br/></span></section><section><span><br/></span></section><section><span><br/></span></section><section><img loading=\"lazy\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" src=\"https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/mmbiz_png/DC1I4Wibt8WNHbPADj5FzqpOtCuNoVWBlgCicyOdicD39NOMRqNZamLich9n8nygpnlCKggsD9R91sdSbuaVAZZAMw/640?wx_fmt=png\"/></section></section></section><section><section><section><section><section><p><strong><span>一、申请资格</span></strong></p></section></section></section></section></section><section><section><section><section><img loading=\"lazy\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" src=\"https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/mmbiz_png/DC1I4Wibt8WNHbPADj5FzqpOtCuNoVWBlrniaeJJ5lM2tRCFMooEmH90X1WUkibD8nEe0Yklnoiae64mYdvrNxXxoA/640?wx_fmt=png\"/></section></section></section></section></section></section></section><section><section><p><span><br/></span></p><p><span>1.坚持党的领导，政治立场坚定，自觉遵守法律法规和学校规章制度，诚实守信、学风端正，身心健康；</span></p><p><span>2.在校期间无任何违法违纪行为，未受过纪律处分，无考试作弊、剽窃他人成果等不良记录；</span></p><p><span>3.申请人健康状况需符合教育部规定的研究生招考体检标准；</span></p><p><span>4.具备报考2026年研究生资格的应届毕业生；</span></p><p><span>5.学习成绩优秀，本科前六学期专业综合排名位居前50%，详见附件（必须有院系教务部门出具加盖公章的成绩证明及专业排名证明）或本科前六学期专业综合排名位居前60%，并获得省级创新创业竞赛获一等奖证书、排名前二的CSCD期刊以上学术论文；</span></p><p><span>6.外语成绩优秀， CET4≥425或者其他同等级别英语水平证明；</span></p><p><span>7.就读高校具有推荐免试资格的高校；</span></p></section></section></section></section><section><p><span><br/></span></p></section><section><section><section><section><section><section><section><section><span><br/></span></section><section><span><br/></span></section><section><span><br/></span></section><section><span><br/></span></section><section><img loading=\"lazy\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" src=\"https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/mmbiz_png/DC1I4Wibt8WNHbPADj5FzqpOtCuNoVWBlgCicyOdicD39NOMRqNZamLich9n8nygpnlCKggsD9R91sdSbuaVAZZAMw/640?wx_fmt=png\"/></section></section></section><section><section><section><section><section><p><strong><span>二、招生专业</span></strong></p></section></section></section></section></section><section><section><section><section><img loading=\"lazy\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" src=\"https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/mmbiz_png/DC1I4Wibt8WNHbPADj5FzqpOtCuNoVWBlrniaeJJ5lM2tRCFMooEmH90X1WUkibD8nEe0Yklnoiae64mYdvrNxXxoA/640?wx_fmt=png\"/></section></section></section></section></section></section></section><section><section><span><br/></span></section><section><span><br/></span></section><section><span><br/></span></section><section><span><br/></span></section><section><span><br/></span></section><section><span><br/></span></section><section><span><br/></span></section><section><img loading=\"lazy\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" src=\"https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/mmbiz_png/DC1I4Wibt8WNHbPADj5FzqpOtCuNoVWBlccNFZ74Nm1pIA415vHr9cJxWo0ic6UxszRrXFibOSBwO1t9dLNULTgrQ/640?wx_fmt=png\"/></section></section></section></section><section><p><span><br/></span></p></section><section><section><section><section><section><section><section><section><img loading=\"lazy\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" src=\"https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/mmbiz_png/DC1I4Wibt8WNHbPADj5FzqpOtCuNoVWBlgCicyOdicD39NOMRqNZamLich9n8nygpnlCKggsD9R91sdSbuaVAZZAMw/640?wx_fmt=png\"/></section></section></section><section><section><section><section><section><p><strong><span>三、申请流程</span></strong></p></section></section></section></section></section><section><section><section><section><img loading=\"lazy\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" src=\"https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/mmbiz_png/DC1I4Wibt8WNHbPADj5FzqpOtCuNoVWBlrniaeJJ5lM2tRCFMooEmH90X1WUkibD8nEe0Yklnoiae64mYdvrNxXxoA/640?wx_fmt=png\"/></section></section></section></section></section></section></section><section><section><img loading=\"lazy\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" src=\"https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/mmbiz_png/DC1I4Wibt8WNHbPADj5FzqpOtCuNoVWBl7ibqIMoia3NSdn4iaHUhrrNlia32WJCpYrlAQSFKtcr564fsq3OB0MovAA/640?wx_fmt=png\"/></section></section><section><p><span>1.在线填写表单：申请人登录网址http://t1.ink/f/gl73nn或手机扫码填写相关信息。</span></p><p><span>2.提交材料清单：</span></p><p><span>（1）《西安建筑科技大学2026年暑期夏令营申请表》1份，(见附件,除签字手写外，其余信息均打印）；</span></p><p><span>（2）本科阶段前四-六学期成绩单及排名证明1份(加盖所在学校教务处或所在学院本科生教务办公章)；</span></p><p><span>（3）国家英语四、六级考试、TOEFL、GRE/GMAT成绩等英语水平成绩单1份；</span></p><p><span>（4）其他证明其学业和学术水平的材料1份（非必要）：如已发表论文、获奖或各类证书复印件等；</span></p><p><span>3.提交方式：</span></p><p><span>申请人将纸质版材料1-4顺序扫描合并为1个PDF格式文档，以“报考专业+姓名+本科就读院校”的形式命名。以压缩包的形式发送至邮箱jkxy_kyb@163.com。</span></p></section></section></section><section><p><span><br/></span></p></section><section><section><section><section><section><section><section><section><img loading=\"lazy\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" src=\"https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/mmbiz_png/DC1I4Wibt8WNHbPADj5FzqpOtCuNoVWBlgCicyOdicD39NOMRqNZamLich9n8nygpnlCKggsD9R91sdSbuaVAZZAMw/640?wx_fmt=png\"/></section></section></section><section><section><section><section><section><p><strong><span>四、活动日程及安排</span></strong></p></section></section></section></section></section><section><section><section><section><img loading=\"lazy\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" src=\"https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/mmbiz_png/DC1I4Wibt8WNHbPADj5FzqpOtCuNoVWBlrniaeJJ5lM2tRCFMooEmH90X1WUkibD8nEe0Yklnoiae64mYdvrNxXxoA/640?wx_fmt=png\"/></section></section></section></section></section></section></section><section><p><span>1.活动报名</span></p><p><span>2025年7月17日至7月30日（确因学校放假等原因无法开具成绩证明的同学可先提交其他材料，证明开具后再补充）。</span></p><p><span>2.材料审核</span></p><p><span>预计8月中旬左右在“建科2026夏令营QQ群”公布入选营员名单，请所有报名同学及时进入QQ群（以“申请者本科学校+姓名”命名），并关注群里活动通知。</span></p></section><section><section><img loading=\"lazy\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" src=\"https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/mmbiz_png/DC1I4Wibt8WNHbPADj5FzqpOtCuNoVWBlOwSMr1KZ6fGpIeWc0To8Gq3dsMe7B77xw1ibfuiaJLPxfJ9wSm5KEOBg/640?wx_fmt=png\"/></section></section><section><p><span>建科2026夏令营QQ群（群号：1042262043）</span></p></section></section></section><section><p><span><br/></span></p></section><section><section><section><section><section><section><section><section><img loading=\"lazy\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" src=\"https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/mmbiz_png/DC1I4Wibt8WNHbPADj5FzqpOtCuNoVWBlgCicyOdicD39NOMRqNZamLich9n8nygpnlCKggsD9R91sdSbuaVAZZAMw/640?wx_fmt=png\"/></section></section></section><section><section><section><section><section><p><strong><span>五、其他事宜</span></strong></p></section></section></section></section></section><section><section><section><section><img loading=\"lazy\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" src=\"https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/mmbiz_png/DC1I4Wibt8WNHbPADj5FzqpOtCuNoVWBlrniaeJJ5lM2tRCFMooEmH90X1WUkibD8nEe0Yklnoiae64mYdvrNxXxoA/640?wx_fmt=png\"/></section></section></section></section></section></section></section><section><p><span><br/></span></p><p><span>学生所申报的申请材料必须真实，如有弄虚作假现象，一经查实，取消申请人所获得的资格。</span></p></section></section></section><section><p><span><br/></span></p></section><section><section><section><section><section><section><section><section><img loading=\"lazy\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" src=\"https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/mmbiz_png/DC1I4Wibt8WNHbPADj5FzqpOtCuNoVWBlgCicyOdicD39NOMRqNZamLich9n8nygpnlCKggsD9R91sdSbuaVAZZAMw/640?wx_fmt=png\"/></section></section></section><section><section><section><section><section><p><strong><span>六、联系方式</span></strong></p></section></section></section></section></section><section><section><section><section><img loading=\"lazy\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" src=\"https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/mmbiz_png/DC1I4Wibt8WNHbPADj5FzqpOtCuNoVWBlrniaeJJ5lM2tRCFMooEmH90X1WUkibD8nEe0Yklnoiae64mYdvrNxXxoA/640?wx_fmt=png\"/></section></section></section></section></section></section></section><section><p><span><br/></span></p><p><span>学院联系人：苗老师  吴老师  </span></p><p><span>学院联系电话：029-82203433 </span></p></section></section></section><section><p><span><br/></span></p></section></section></section></section><section><span><a href=\"https://mp.weixin.qq.com/s/rz5R1_y_u3-UsFl_aQTKAA\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">附件：西安建筑科技大学2025年“暑期夏令营”申请表.doc</a></span></section><section><span><br/></span></section><section><img alt=\"图片\" loading=\"lazy\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" src=\"https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/mmbiz_jpg/DC1I4Wibt8WOaUO2CulQk8Tay4iaKJNUGxefX31D4B79UiblRTyRDc0tqsgQP8oaJWuyz4yeyfZY615Wc6KibHxiaXw/640?wx_fmt=jpeg\"/></section><section></section><section><section><section><section><p><span><span>往期回顾</span></span></p></section></section></section></section><section><span><section><span><section><section><section><span><section><section><section><section><section><section><section><section><section><section><section><img alt=\"图片\" loading=\"lazy\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" src=\"https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/mmbiz_gif/DC1I4Wibt8WNU4Tjeozke8qkr7a7JxiaQvlUcTTTBh5k4C3QXfbI9YfkXgrJYogVdROFBQKwPaZ06pW3UuWFxvjA/640?wx_fmt=gif\"/></section></section></section></section><section><section><section><section><p><a href=\"https://mp.weixin.qq.com/s?__biz=Mzg3OTA1ODEyNw==&amp;mid=2247793641&amp;idx=1&amp;sn=1a5ca369e413020850e77eeb10605b2d&amp;scene=21#wechat_redirect\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><span><img loading=\"lazy\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" src=\"https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/mmbiz_jpg/DC1I4Wibt8WMscibMib2ibNtpZPhib7y4ibKeSquZ30XfOYeHeskWKCOPLsiaibMBkwVGdLTqibxt8KCNVxWRnpibyAkUwvw/640?wx_fmt=jpeg\"/></span></a></p><p><a href=\"https://mp.weixin.qq.com/s?__biz=Mzg3OTA1ODEyNw==&amp;mid=2247793928&amp;idx=1&amp;sn=62c448d6bbb8512320d4d790332f7008&amp;scene=21#wechat_redirect\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><span><img loading=\"lazy\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" src=\"https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/mmbiz_jpg/DC1I4Wibt8WMscibMib2ibNtpZPhib7y4ibKeSnfFZWmfEOdjJEZ938Y51LHeXTwUrYvfMRJBnwhoHNDoZKyrsbibJMeg/640?wx_fmt=jpeg\"/></span></a></p><p><a href=\"https://mp.weixin.qq.com/s?__biz=Mzg3OTA1ODEyNw==&amp;mid=2247794204&amp;idx=1&amp;sn=335575910e7d536f45d580127afa9dad&amp;scene=21#wechat_redirect\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><span><img loading=\"lazy\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" src=\"https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/mmbiz_jpg/DC1I4Wibt8WMscibMib2ibNtpZPhib7y4ibKeSfYfiac20PV5NbXHibomj6e0NSLiaGlJadjGCv8mN1zD91FACdBoSgrnvw/640?wx_fmt=jpeg\"/></span></a></p><section><span><br/></span></section></section></section></section></section></section></section></section></section></section></section></section><p><span><span><span><br/></span></span></span></p></span></section></section></section><p><span>图文编辑 | 杨泽宇</span></p><p><span>责任</span><span><span>编辑</span></span><span><span> </span><span><span>| 程</span><span>　诚</span></span></span></p></span></section></span><span><p><span><span>初审 | </span><span>王艺潼</span><span><span><br/></span></span></span></p><span><p><span><span><span><span>复审 |</span><span><span> </span><span>苗志超</span></span></span></span></span></p><p><span><span><span><span><span>终审 | 吴永婷</span></span></span></span></span></p></span></span></section><section><span><br/></span></section><section><img alt=\"图片\" loading=\"lazy\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" src=\"assets/articles/media/e2eb5af6e52c3d599df0.gif\"/></section></section><section><span><br/></span></section><p></p></div>","textSha256":"9a1d48049ab087deab25146ddc71a7fc9eb0138a3dfa6f5921380fb81c17adcc","textLength":1686,"sourceSha256":"9dbb1a85caa6af3fa6df813023244099514b9e312bacb45bd206d04403ba7456","selector":"#js_content","attachments":[],"pdfs":[],"unavailableMedia":[],"id":"syp-b0bdcc30f7fd6b318153","title":"2025年西安建筑科技大学建筑设备科学与工程学院2026年优秀研究生生源选拔暑期夏令营的通知","capturedAt":"2026-11-15T16:58:26.566076+00:00","mirroredImages":[{"sourceUrl":"http://mmbiz.qpic.cn/mmbiz_gif/DC1I4Wibt8WOaTxEQ56QJQgp6BOK9Ay5LG6DJL2aRbH9oAcaicjDJicfYOsOrR4F8UuJmMibQOLxCiavOzicumZFDRdQ/640?wx_fmt=gif","file":"assets/articles/media/e2eb5af6e52c3d599df0.gif"}]}
